<title>GERMANY: Puma details 1996 sales, profits.</title>
<headline>Puma details 1996 sales, profits.</headline>
<dateline>HERZOGENAURACH, Germany 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   83.8    vs 48.2</p>
<p>    Group extra ordinary gain		24.1    vs 0</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     64.9    vs 51.9</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share		 3.88    vs 3.44 marks</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   65.2    vs 60.6</p>
<p>    Group net sales			    489.9   vs 413.6</p>
<p>    Group worldwide sales with licences  1,162   vs 1,129</p>
<p>    Group gross return on sales	    13.2    vs 12.5 pct</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    807     vs 745</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German sportswear group is Puma AG.</p>
</text>
